# 27. AI Agents and Network Infrastructure

Network configuration is another infrastructure layer.

A clean architecture is:

```text
Agent
 ↓
Account
 ↓
Environment
 ├── Browser
 └── Network
```

The AI agent does not need to reason about low-level network configuration for every task.

The infrastructure layer should resolve the correct environment.

This reduces unnecessary coupling between intelligence and infrastructure.

